                                "example_id": "b5de2bd8-def9-4761-8163-79002ade4520",
                                "sense_id": "736be6c4-6986-3d56-b7c0-74054a181457",
                                "text": "Ushered into the small front room, Podson found himself restored to a habitable world. A tightly stuffed couch, chintz-covered armchairs, an overmantel mirror with swans painted on it, flowers in various vases, photos in metal frames."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7944ccb6-89f0-4835-9aef-e98ee9b6a7d6",
                                "sense_id": "736be6c4-6986-3d56-b7c0-74054a181457",
                                "text": "She strode to the fireplace and examined a lidded crystal vase on the overmantel."
